<title>Yemen and the Red Sea: the situation</title>
<link>https://map.igred.org/crisis/yemen/</link>
<guid isPermaLink="false">igred-summary-yemen-2026-11-24T02:26:43.535Z</guid>
<pubDate>Tue, 24 Nov 2026 02:26:43 GMT</pubDate>
<description>&lt;p&gt;Houthi forces have intensified attacks across Yemen, launching missiles from Saada toward Aden that fell in Dhamar and striking civilian vehicles in Lahj, killing a child and injuring three others, while a drone targeting the southern region was intercepted by the Saudi coalition in the Red Sea. Saudi-led coalition forces also intercepted a Houthi drone and a missile in western Yemen and struck a Houthi arms depot east of Taiz. The conflict continues to cause high civilian casualties, including dozens of children killed, and 918 battle-related deaths were recorded in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.un.org/feed/view/en/story/2026/11/1168830&quot;&gt;UN News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMipwFBVV95cUxOMVR0Um1jTVhZaVJCb0xZN2NkZjdiNHNwbTEwRzFhTHZHbVpsNTNiQnduMEpRQWlTQVgxNlotNkh4dVNUWkEwWUZIOW11NjNKWjlkaEk0eW5IUHc2UmdMS1AzbmpGaE5MdHhnd21QWGMwckVnMzdfZ2p4Q09nZm1HaEt0MVQ0X2FpYUJEVEtYNHVfVFhPQlpJc05FRTd4bnIwcXc0NEJ1Yw?oc=5&quot;&gt;Bloomberg.com&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMicEFVX3lxTFBMMHBmaVctaWVwLWxRbGJMbjZyZlU4aUNNTUQ1aTdFNHBWd2ZtZkU4RXdTQ0p6SHIwY3gyR1hwVUZFVEZOVXNCb1Q0UG5IWWJ1M2xWZTd6OU5ac2YyZjNaVzVPODhwc2VKdHdDYmJNSkI?oc=5&quot;&gt;ORF Middle East&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMioAFBVV95cUxQYWt2end4cTNLRHBhMnZGQlBSQlVZNDdQWF9jTDJuaUtJWGI2OEU1TWw4X0QxaFBHZUt4eGtaazJxVkxPR3Z0cDV2VVZWMGdoVHliRk9fLW9FVURnZ1ZHOXhpYk1NUHBaeXI0LTd5TWJkWEx5RHdUMU1GZXMybmI3RmsxVXNGWUhNS3dyTDFkTy1OZUw2N2FNa21XaWxSZ0VZ?oc=5&quot;&gt;Anadolu Ajansı&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiggFBVV95cUxQZDlXbXpiU2cwRGZTckR6TUc1RXMyUlBoS1hGd0NBdmEzYTZOQ3hLdElPbkVlU1lfX2g3RGJ4UnZVOFRCY3drMURtdGRBU1FCcDdRVm1RVkNZRS1GRlVUOHhqYmxPRXlvM1FIUzk2ejU4N0xrRW5VOWVZVUVmVFUwTEp3?oc=5&quot;&gt